 "Los cuatro condicionales": "De vier conditionals",
 "Estructura": "Structuur",
 "Cero": "Nul",
 "if + present, present": "if + present, present",
 "If you heat ice, it melts.": "If you heat ice, it melts.",
 "Primero": "Eerste",
 "if + present, will + verbo": "if + present, will + werkwoord",
 "If it rains, I will stay.": "If it rains, I will stay.",
 "Segundo": "Tweede",
 "if + past, would + verbo": "if + past, would + werkwoord",
 "If I had money, I would travel.": "If I had money, I would travel.",
 "Tercero": "Derde",
 "if + past perfect, would have + participio": "if + past perfect, would have + voltooid deelwoord",
 "If I had studied, I would have passed.": "If I had studied, I would have passed.",
 "Cada tipo habla de una situación distinta: real, posible, improbable o imposible.": "Elk type spreekt over een andere situatie: reëel, mogelijk, onwaarschijnlijk of onmogelijk.",
 "Insistid en que «If it will rain» es un error muy frecuente en hispanohablantes.": "Benadruk dat «If it will rain» een heel veelvoorkomende fout is bij Nederlandstaligen.",
 "Condicional cero y primero": "Conditional nul en eerste",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#69a8ff\">Cero: hechos</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If you mix red and blue, you get purple.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#69a8ff\">Nul: feiten</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If you mix red and blue, you get purple.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ffb455\">Primero: posible futuro</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I finish early, I will call you.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ffb455\">Eerste: mogelijke toekomst</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I finish early, I will call you.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#5ed8a4\">Clave</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">En la parte if no se usa «will».</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#5ed8a4\">Sleutel</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">In het if-deel gebruik je geen «will».</span>",
 "El segundo condicional habla del presente o del futuro irreal. El tercero habla de un pasado que ya no se puede cambiar.": "De tweede conditional gaat over het onwerkelijke heden of de onwerkelijke toekomst. De derde gaat over een verleden dat niet meer kan worden veranderd.",
 "Condicional segundo y tercero": "Conditional tweede en derde",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#69a8ff\">Segundo: irreal o improbable</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I were rich, I would buy a house.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#69a8ff\">Tweede: onwerkelijk of onwaarschijnlijk</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I were rich, I would buy a house.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ffb455\">Tercero: pasado imposible</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I had left earlier, I would have arrived on time.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#ffb455\">Derde: onmogelijk verleden</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">If I had left earlier, I would have arrived on time.</span>",
 "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#5ed8a4\">Pista</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">Con I, he, she, it se puede decir «if I were».</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:26px;color:#5ed8a4\">Hint</b><br><span style=\"font-size:21px;color:#edf1ff\">Bij I, he, she, it kun je «if I were» zeggen.</span>",
